{"root":{"data":{"id":"13303c445588","created":1619593097,"text":"mysql技术内幕innodb存储引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz5vau4t8g0","created":1619593187419,"text":"mysql体系结构和存储引擎","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz69myawk00","created":1619594310891,"text":"定义数据库和实例","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz73ebh0e80","created":1619596643021,"text":"数据库"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz73loluwg0","created":1619596659053,"text":"物理操作系统文件或其他形式文件类型的集合。mysql中数据库文件可以是frm，myd，myi，ibd结尾的文件。当使用ndb引擎时，数据库的文件可不是操作系统上的文件，而是存放于内存之中的文件，但是定义仍不变"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz73hdxsm80","created":1619596649701,"text":"实例"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz76ruajt40","created":1619596907550,"text":"数据库实由数据库后台进程/线程以及一个共享内存组成的。共享内存可以被运行的文件后台进程/线程所共享。需要牢记的是，数据库实例才是真正用来操作数据库文件的。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz79lb45r40","created":1619597128422,"text":"数据库和实例一一对应，在集群情况下可能存在一个数据库可被多个实例使用的情况"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz7cv9lepc0","created":1619597385190,"text":"mysql读取配置文件顺序：/etc/my.cnf /etc/mysql/my.cnf /usr/local/mysql/etc/my.cnf ~/.my.cnf"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz69v407ds0","created":1619594328650,"text":"mysql体系结构","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz7fg14g880","created":1619597587119,"text":"连接池组件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz7fousbsw0","created":1619597606327,"text":"管理服务和工具组件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz7fwc5t1c0","created":1619597622615,"text":"sql接口组件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz7g6bi1ew0","created":1619597644343,"text":"查询分析器组件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz7ghlexqg0","created":1619597668887,"text":"优化器组件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz7gwad33s0","created":1619597700870,"text":"缓冲组件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz7h3zj1oo0","created":1619597717630,"text":"插件式存储引擎"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz7hlfqim80","created":1619597755615,"text":"物理文件"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz6a0n49sw0","created":1619594340690,"text":"mysql表存储引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz7phavu480","created":1619598373528,"text":"innodb"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz7tn85pjk0","created":1619598699880,"text":"支持师傅主要面向在线事务处理方面应用。其特点是性锁设计，支持外键，支持类似非锁读，默认的引擎。innodb春芳在一个逻辑表空间中，这个表空间像黑盒一样有innodb自身4.1开始它可以将每个innodb存储硬气表单独存放到一个独立的ibd文件。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cazsqb0n0nc0","created":1619657681520,"text":"MYISAM存储引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazsrbv0ej40","created":1619657761720,"text":"官方提供引擎不支持事务，表锁和全文索引"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cazssoypx1k0","created":1619657868607,"text":"NDB存储引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazst2v874g0","created":1619657898871,"text":"NDB存储引擎时一个集群存储引擎，特点是数据全部存放内存中（5.1开始可以将非索引放到磁盘上），问题NDB存储连接JOIN在数据库层延迟复杂操作巨大网络开销查询速度慢"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cazswy0u0wg0","created":1619658201782,"text":"Memory存储引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazsxpx07bc0","created":1619658262501,"text":"数据在内存重启数据会丢失用哈希索引，速度快只支持表锁，并发性能差"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cazsyu8njnc0","created":1619658350276,"text":"Archive存储引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazsztvd6bc0","created":1619658427837,"text":"只支持插入和查询 不是事务安全的存储引擎，设计目的主要提供高速的插入和压缩功能"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cazt1ckbjrs0","created":1619658546892,"text":"Federated存储引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazt1sn0yc00","created":1619658581884,"text":"不存放数据，指向一台远程mysql数据库服务器上的表不支持异构数据库表"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cazt2p4vd7k0","created":1619658652620,"text":"maria存储引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazt3ic5sl40","created":1619658716188,"text":"MYISAM延续特点缓存数据和索引文件，行索引设计，提供mvcc功能，支持事务，和非事务安全支持"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cazt4j5206g0","created":1619658796299,"text":"其他引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazt5kq43h40","created":1619658878114,"text":"当表数据大于1000w时，mysql的性能会急剧下降吗，不是 需要选择正确的存储引擎，"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz6aca9nn40","created":1619594366034,"text":"各种存储引擎之间的比较"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6aq9pe5c0","created":1619594396475,"text":"连接mysql"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazt7eripbc0","created":1619659021866,"text":"TCP/IP"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazt8kd7tkw0","created":1619659112426,"text":"命名管道和共享内存"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazt8u3eu000","created":1619659133601,"text":"Unix域套接字"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz6audlwag0","created":1619594405418,"text":"小结"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz67di4znk0","created":1619594133594,"text":"innodb存储引擎","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz6b2013zs0","created":1619594422011,"text":"innodb存储引擎概述"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caztb92f6cg0","created":1619659322921,"text":"一些网站上存超过1TB数据，一些站点每秒插入800次操作"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz6boyryhs0","created":1619594472002,"text":"innodb体系架构"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caztg0e6rmo0","created":1619659695863,"text":"后台线程"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caztg7iloww0","created":1619659711367,"text":"内存","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caztgfmv1080","created":1619659729039,"text":"缓冲池","priority":1},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazth3pbo4g0","created":1619659781430,"text":"配置文件 innodb_buffer_pool_size"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caztn084acg0","created":1619660244045,"text":"占最大块内存部分，用来存放各种数据的缓存，因为innodb的存储引擎的工作方式总是讲数据库文件按页（16k）读到缓存池，按照最少使用算法保留在缓冲池中的缓存数据，缓冲页更改按照一定频率将缓冲池刷新到文件  free buffers 空闲缓存帧  "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazu4bpih6g0","created":1619661601232,"text":"命令 ： show engine innodb status;"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caztgmp0l6g0","created":1619659744407,"text":"重做日志缓冲池","priority":1},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazti3mhhns0","created":1619659859623,"text":"配置文件innodb_log_buffer_size"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazu4wpmb7s0","created":1619661646951,"text":"每秒产生的事务量在这个大小即可"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caztgt8ij2w0","created":1619659758646,"text":"额外的内存池","priority":1},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caztiwb3tpc0","created":1619659922062,"text":"配置文件 innodb_additional_mem_pool_size"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazu5dp9nhs0","created":1619661683935,"text":"该内存不够时会从缓冲池中申请，缓存池很大的时候这个值应该增加"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz6bvwfxrs0","created":1619594487098,"text":"master thread  "},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazu7nkmhwg0","created":1619661862150,"text":"innodb存储引擎的主要工作都是在一个单独的master thread 完成"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazu8ihz83c0","created":1619661929470,"text":"主循环"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazu8nwl9400","created":1619661941238,"text":"后台循环"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazu8qvr7ug0","created":1619661947718,"text":"刷新循环"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazu8vlibog0","created":1619661957982,"text":"暂停循环"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz6carhiwo0","created":1619594519450,"text":"关键特性 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6cfbogdc0","created":1619594529378,"text":"启动、关闭与恢复 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6cllx68w0","created":1619594543058,"text":"InnoDB Plugin = 新版本的InnoDB存储引擎 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6crv3gzs0","created":1619594556674,"text":"小结 "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz67mviclk0","created":1619594153994,"text":"文件","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz6d09yic00","created":1619594574986,"text":"参数文件 "},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazul5ow0og0","created":1619662920324,"text":"动态"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazul8y7awo0","created":1619662927418,"text":"静态"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz6d466qsg0","created":1619594583467,"text":"日志文件 "},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazule3fdls0","created":1619662938618,"text":"错误日志"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazulh037a80","created":1619662944946,"text":"慢查询日志","priority":1},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazulnc6o9k0","created":1619662958738,"text":"sql语句没有使用索引"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazun4e9cpk0","created":1619663074233,"text":"慢查询日志放到一张表中"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cazunrv6iy00","created":1619663125322,"text":"查询日志"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazunzhp57s0","created":1619663141921,"text":"二进制日志"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cazuo54nifk0","created":1619663154193,"text":"恢复"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cazuo9hka0g0","created":1619663163681,"text":"复制"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz6d82b6ww0","created":1619594591938,"text":" 套接字文件 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6dc3v3go0","created":1619594600739,"text":"pid文件 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6dg6av1c0","created":1619594609594,"text":"表结构定义文件 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6dk05pyo0","created":1619594617930,"text":"InnoDB存储引擎文件 "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz67so5py00","created":1619594166610,"text":"表","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz6dr07oqg0","created":1619594633170,"text":"InnoDB存储引擎表类型 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6dy8zmf40","created":1619594648938,"text":" InnoDB逻辑存储结构 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6e3bypj40","created":1619594660002,"text":"InnoDB物理存储结构 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6e7dmpk80","created":1619594668810,"text":"InnoDB行记录格式 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6eefegb40","created":1619594684155,"text":" InnoDB数据页结构 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6ek283zk0","created":1619594696419,"text":" Named File Formats "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6eox575s0","created":1619594706995,"text":"约束 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6etqbwrs0","created":1619594717467,"text":"视图 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6ez2focw0","created":1619594729083,"text":"分区表 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6f2o78zk0","created":1619594736930,"text":"小结 "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz67vegm000","created":1619594172554,"text":"索引和算法","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz6f8qmyr40","created":1619594750138,"text":"InnoDB存储引擎索引概述 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6fddh8io0","created":1619594760226,"text":" 二分查找法 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6fgvu5eg0","created":1619594767866,"text":"平衡二叉树 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6fkba8sw0","created":1619594775331,"text":"B+树  "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6gebosfs0","created":1619594840659,"text":"B+树索引 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6ghyxz1k0","created":1619594848595,"text":" B+树索引的使用 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6gls0mig0","created":1619594856883,"text":"哈希算法 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6gpl2z340","created":1619594865171,"text":"小结 "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz683vf8yo0","created":1619594190994,"text":"锁","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz6gvmbu5c0","created":1619594878307,"text":"什么是锁 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6h0uutbc0","created":1619594889707,"text":"InnoDB存储引擎中的锁 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6h8b6fbk0","created":1619594905931,"text":"锁的算法 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6hefq6fc0","created":1619594919267,"text":"锁问题 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6hhus3js0","created":1619594926707,"text":"阻塞 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6hmsbjlk0","created":1619594937443,"text":"死锁 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6hq54n740","created":1619594944747,"text":"锁升级 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6htfxgps0","created":1619594951931,"text":"小结 "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz686ijvc80","created":1619594196746,"text":"事务","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz6hzvlf3s0","created":1619594965939,"text":"事务概述 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6i49pbvk0","created":1619594975499,"text":"事务的实现 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6i7z292o0","created":1619594983563,"text":"事务控制语句 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6icemtio0","created":1619594993211,"text":"隐式提交的SQL语句 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6igms9yg0","created":1619595002411,"text":"对于事务操作的统计 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6ikbm1nk0","created":1619595010443,"text":"事务的隔离级别 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6inqj2zk0","created":1619595017875,"text":"分布式事务 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6iri0ic80","created":1619595026067,"text":"不好的事务习惯 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6ivyre8w0","created":1619595035787,"text":"小结 "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz689idlz40","created":1619594203266,"text":"备份和恢复","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz6klnx2kw0","created":1619595170092,"text":"备份与恢复概述"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6ko142ao0","created":1619595175244,"text":"冷备 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6kq1hxjs0","created":1619595179620,"text":"逻辑备份 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6s1ns44o0","created":1619595753461,"text":"二进制日志备份与恢复 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6s8942nc0","created":1619595767812,"text":"热备 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6sd0zfpk0","created":1619595778204,"text":"快照备份 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6shn0rq00","created":1619595788244,"text":"复制 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6sl1e8qw0","created":1619595795644,"text":"小结 "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz68etao800","created":1619594214810,"text":"性能调优","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz6sqknezs0","created":1619595807692,"text":"选择合适的CPU "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6sues2ns0","created":1619595816044,"text":"内存的重要性 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6sy9ozbk0","created":1619595824444,"text":"硬盘对数据库性能的影响 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6t1mr5pk0","created":1619595831764,"text":"合理地设置RAID "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6t4rcpi00","created":1619595838572,"text":"操作系统的选择也很重要 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6t7s4gmg0","created":1619595845149,"text":"不同的文件系统对数据库性能的影响 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6tbp9shs0","created":1619595853684,"text":"选择合适的基准测试工具 "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caz68k5ey7c0","created":1619594226427,"text":"innoDB存储引擎代码的编译和调试","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caz6tlhhbrc0","created":1619595874980,"text":"获取InnoDB存储引擎源代码 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6toxfuo80","created":1619595882476,"text":"InnoDB源代码结构 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6tskywuo0","created":1619595890429,"text":"编译和调试InnoDB源代码 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6twkiqhk0","created":1619595899109,"text":"Windows下的调试 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6tzt38x40","created":1619595906157,"text":"Linux下的调试 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caz6u391sq00","created":1619595913653,"text":"小结 "},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}